        "id": 13772,
        "name": "Arcanist Lupus",
        "username": "Arcanist_Lupus",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arcanist_lupus/{size}/2169_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-10-16T06:16:58.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>While impressive, the spirits of Spirit Island possess rather unwieldy names. &nbsp;So the time has come to give them all nicknames!</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Here are my proposals. &nbsp;Some are terrible, some are obscure (or not) references, and some are unimaginative, but here they are:</p><p><strong>Lightning's Swift Strike:</strong> Sparky<br><strong>River Surges in Sunlight: </strong><span>Splashy</span><br><strong>Vital Strength of the Earth:</strong><span> Rocky&nbsp;</span><br><strong>Shadows Flicker Like Flames:</strong><span> Plato</span><br><strong>Ocean's Hungry Grasp:</strong><span> Ed</span><br><strong>A Spread of Rampant Green: </strong><span>Audrey II</span><br><strong>Bringer of Dreams and Nightmares: </strong><span>Boo</span><br><strong>Thunderspeaker:</strong><span> Bang</span><br><strong>Serpent Slumbering Beneath the Island:</strong><span> The Bi-Colored-Python-Rock-Snake</span><br><strong>Heart of the Wildfire:</strong><span> Bouncy&nbsp;</span><br><strong>Sharp Fangs Behind the Leaves:</strong><span> Mr. Chomps&nbsp;</span><br><strong>Keeper of the Forbidden Wilds:</strong><span> Maro</span><br><strong>Volcano Looms on High: </strong><span>Sir Not-Appearing-in-this-Game</span></p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:45:40.567Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
